The signatures are collected one office at a time and published together, which
is the point: a KO deputy who has signed for marriage in front of their own
voters cannot quietly be absent on the day. The bloc is not a coalition and has
no discipline beyond embarrassment, and embarrassment turns out to be
sufficient for a first reading.

The price is paid immediately by the conservative partner, who reads a
published list of names as a decision to govern without them on anything that
matters to their electorate.

- @poland_event_queue: File the joint timetable

