Q.last_policy_implementation = 0;
Q.news_headline = "Partnership is put first and marriage is held back";
!}

The conservative partner can sign a partnership bill and does, in exchange for
the marriage draft staying in a drawer until after the next election. It is a
real law with real registry offices behind it, and it will change the lives of
people who are currently strangers to each other in hospital corridors.

It is also the fourth time the movement has been told the ambitious version is
next. The organisers who filled the squares in 2020 do not stop working. They
do stop assuming.

- @poland_event_queue: Table the partnership bill

