if (Q.left_in_government) Q.government_delivery += 2;
Q.last_policy_stage = Q.left_in_government
    ? "Implementation"
    : "Proposal";
Q.last_policy_authority = Q.left_in_government
    ? "Education ministry and the budget process"
    : "Parliamentary opposition";
Q.last_policy_implementation = Q.left_in_government ? 1 : 0;
Q.news_headline = "Catechism moves to the edge of the school day and the Church Fund is audited";
!}

Religion classes at the beginning or end of the day rather than wedged between
mathematics and physics; a published account of what the Church Fund pays for
and to whom. Neither measure touches the treaty, both change what an ordinary
family and an ordinary accountant experience, and both survive contact with a
hostile Palace because neither needs a new statute.

The bishops protest in proportion — loudly, briefly, and without the language
of persecution that a treaty fight would have handed them.

- @poland_event_queue: Sign the instruction

@concordat_hold
title: Leave it alone while the rights bills are live
subtitle: Protects the two-bill timetable at the cost of looking like a party that flinches.
on-arrival: {!
Q.public_mood_pending_secular_state_salience -= 3;
