Q.spring_dissent += 3;
Q.progressive_credibility -= 2;
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.news_headline = "The Left keeps the Church out of the argument while the bills are live";
!}

The leadership decides that a party fighting for two rights bills cannot also
be fighting the episcopate, and that of the two arguments only one has a
parliamentary majority worth protecting. The instruction goes out: no Concordat
questions answered beyond a formula about the constitution.

It is a defensible sequencing decision. It is heard by the party's own secular
activists as the discovery that there is always a bill whose timetable comes
first.

- @poland_event_queue: Hold the line

@spring_market_turn
# prose-audit: Grade A — The Ruch Postępu doctrine becomes concrete policy with named beneficiaries and named losers, the 2011 precedent is used as an argument rather than decoration, and all three routes move the economic axis, the professional vote and the labour flank in different directions.
title: Ruch Postępu goes to market
subtitle: A socially liberal party has to say what fiscally conservative actually means in złoty
face-image: img/poland/events/sejm-chamber.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 24
order: 6
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and spring_path_route = "market_liberal" and time >= spring_route_time + 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.spring_market_room = (Number(Q.left_economic_position) || 0) >= 64
    ? "The party is already further right than most of its own MPs stood for election on."
    : "There is still room on the axis before the party's own MPs start reading their leaflets from 2023 aloud.";
Q.news_headline = "The Left prepares a tax and self-employment package";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Two hundred thousand invoices

The conference room is full of people the Left has not had in a room since the
1990s: software contractors, physiotherapists on business licences, a woman who
runs four bakeries and files more paperwork than she bakes. None of them are
rich. All of them are treated by the tax and social-insurance system as if the
distinction between them and a corporation were administrative.

[+ spring_market_room +] The lesson taken from 2011 is not a tax lesson. What
briefly worked then was a promise that a modern party would stop treating these
people as suspects, and it collapsed because there was nothing behind it once
the applause stopped. This time there are two rights bills behind it, a
parliamentary club, and an electorate that has already moved.

[? if razem_active = 1 and razem_in_left = 1: Razem has published its own
costing of the package before the party has finished writing it.?][? if
left_in_government = 1: A tax package from a governing party is a budget
negotiation, not a leaflet: the finance ministry will price every line.?]

- @market_full
- @market_selfemployed
- @market_spectacle

@market_full
title: Table the full package: flatter tax, lower ZUS, less permitting
subtitle: The complete Ruch Postępu programme. It buys the professional vote outright while Lewica Pracy MPs and union organisers prepare an open campaign against it.
