    ? "Cabinet fiscal proposal"
    : "Parliamentary opposition";
Q.last_policy_implementation = 0;
Q.news_headline = "Contribution relief for the self-employed becomes the Left's economic offer";
!}

The bill fits on four pages and can be defended by any candidate without
notes: people earning a modest living on a business licence should not pay a
flat social-insurance charge designed for people earning several times as much.
It is popular, it is cheap, and it does not require the party to say the word
"deregulation" once.

It also does not deliver the realignment the doctrine promised. The
professional vote notices; it does not move house.

- @poland_event_queue: Table the relief bill

@market_spectacle
title: Skip the tax bill and make the fight about the Church and the police
subtitle: The original 2011 method: cheap, loud, and it changes nobody's balance sheet.
