Q.spring_rupture_dissent = Math.round(Number(Q.razem_dissent) || 0);
Q.news_headline = "Razem opens the question of leaving the common Left";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — The one thing they were founded not to do

**Adrian Zandberg** does not make a scene. He brings arithmetic: Razem's
dissent inside the common project stands at **[+ spring_rupture_dissent +]/100**,
its national council has met twice about this doctrine, and its members joined
a party that exists because they believed the Polish left had already once
traded its economics for respectability and never got either back.

The complaint is specific and difficult to answer on the merits. A party may
campaign for marriage equality and lower contributions at the same time; it
cannot campaign for marriage equality and lower contributions and also claim to
be the political representation of people who work for wages. Razem is not
threatening to leave over a bill. It is saying that the sentence adopted at the
convention has already ended the thing it joined.

[? if left_in_government = 1: Both organisations are inside a governing
arrangement, which means the divorce would be conducted in front of coalition
partners who have their own reasons to enjoy it.?]

- @rupture_let_go
- @rupture_buy_back
- @rupture_divorce

@rupture_let_go
title: Let them go and take the ground they leave behind
subtitle: The split proceeds through the exit congress. The party becomes coherent and smaller.
on-arrival: {!
Q.razem_dissent = 100;
Q.razem_escalation_stage = 7;
Q.razem_demand_answered = 1;
Q.razem_grievance_memory += 15;
Q.left_economic_position += 2;
Q.market_liberal_support += 6;
Q.liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 2;
Q.ko_relation += 3;
Q.spring_strength += 3;
Q.spring_dissent -= 4;
Q.party_unity -= 4;
Q.news_headline = "The leadership tells Razem to hold its congress";
!}

The answer given to Zandberg is that the convention voted, that the vote stands,
and that a party which renegotiates its identity every time a current threatens
to leave does not have an identity. Razem's exit congress is now a matter of
scheduling.

What follows belongs to Razem's own procedures and to every one of its deputies
individually: offices, local organisers and personal followings will decide who
actually walks. The Left that remains will be smaller, easier to explain and no
longer required to pretend its economic programme is a compromise.

- @poland_caucus_dynamics.router: Let the exit congress run

@rupture_buy_back
title: Retreat one step and buy the alliance back
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A costed social floor written into the doctrine; the market pitch loses its edge.
