Q.news_headline = "A written social floor keeps Razem inside the fiscally conservative Left";
!}

The doctrine acquires an annex: a floor under public-service wages, the
contribution relief financed rather than merely announced, and a commitment
that the word "simplification" will never again appear in a party document
without a distributional table beside it.

Razem signs. The business press files the story under "the Polish left
discovers it is still the Polish left", and the professional voters who arrived
in the last six months hear a party that flinched the first time somebody
objected.

- @poland_event_queue: Sign the annex

@rupture_divorce
title: Agree a clean divorce and an electoral non-aggression pact
subtitle: Two parties, negotiated terms, no expulsion. The threshold arithmetic gets harder for both.
on-arrival: {!
Q.caucus_exit_target = "razem";
Q.caucus_exit_mode = "orderly";
Q.razem_demand_answered = 1;
Q.razem_escalation_stage = 0;
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.party_unity -= 2;
Q.spring_strength += 2;
Q.news_headline = "Razem and the Left separate by agreement";
!}

Both leaderships appear at the same table and say the same sentence: this is
one country, two projects, and no useful purpose is served by pretending
otherwise for another eighteen months. The terms cover staff, the parliamentary
club, shared local structures and an undertaking not to campaign against each
other's candidates in the seats where the right would collect the difference.

It is the most adult thing either organisation has done in five years, and it
still means two lists, two thresholds and a right-wing majority that gets to
watch the left half of the country divide itself in public.

- @poland_caucus_dynamics.resolve_exit: Register the separation

@spring_right_counterattack
# prose-audit: Grade B — PiS and Konfederacja attack the two doctrines with different weapons, and the response options choose between defending the rights terrain, contesting Konfederacja's freedom argument and lowering the temperature, each with a distinct electoral price.
title: The right picks its line of attack
subtitle: PiS and Konfederacja have both read the new programme and neither of them is confused by it
face-image: img/poland/events/grzegorz-braun-2025.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 24
order: 8
max-visits: 1
