Q.public_mood_pending_abortion_rights_left_ownership += 5;
Q.progressive_credibility += 4;
Q.feminist_trust += 4;
Q.young_support += 3;
Q.urban_progressive_support += 3;
Q.provincial_welfare_left_affinity -= 2;
Q.rural_localists_left_affinity -= 2;
Q.pis_relation -= 4;
Q.konf_relation -= 4;
Q.left_poll_momentum += 0.15;
Q.news_headline = "The Left answers the attack by escalating on rights";
!}

Every attack is answered with the bill it was designed to bury. The leadership
spends a fortnight refusing to discuss anything except two laws and the names
of the people who are blocking them, and the party's own voters — who have been
waiting for a leadership that does not apologise — respond immediately.

The disputed middle responds too, in both directions. The argument gets louder
and the number of people who have no view about it gets smaller, which is
exactly what the strategy intended and exactly what makes it dangerous.

- @poland_event_queue: Escalate

@counter_freedom
title: Fight Konfederacja for the young liberal vote
subtitle: Take their argument off them: freedom that includes women, tenants and gay people.
on-arrival: {!
Q.konf_poll_momentum -= 0.35;
Q.anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 4;
Q.metropolitan_liberals_left_affinity += 2;
Q.liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 2;
Q.young_support += 4;
Q.public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership += 4;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.konf_relation -= 6;
if (Q.spring_path_route == "market_liberal") Q.left_right_score += 2;
Q.labor_dissent += 3;
Q.razem_dissent += 4;
Q.left_poll_momentum += 0.20;
Q.news_headline = "The Left contests Konfederacja's freedom argument directly";
!}

The campaign is built around a single question asked in every format
Konfederacja's supporters actually watch: whose freedom, exactly. A tax
argument aimed at a twenty-six-year-old contractor, delivered by a party that
also intends to let him marry whoever he likes and will not send the police
after his private life.

It works on the margin that matters and it costs credibility on the flank the
Left already has. Every hour spent on the radical right's terrain is an hour
Lewica Pracy MPs and union partners watch it standing somewhere they never
agreed to go.

- @poland_event_queue: Take the argument to them

@counter_cool
title: Refuse the argument and let the salience fall
subtitle: Protect delivery and coalition peace; concede the framing for now.
on-arrival: {!
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience -= 4;
Q.public_mood_pending_abortion_rights_salience -= 3;
